<title>USA: Lexington B &amp; L Fin'l sets first dividend.</title>
<headline>Lexington B &amp; L Fin'l sets first dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mo. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lexington B &amp; L Financial Corp said Tuesday its board of directors approved payment of an initial semi-annual cash dividend of $0.15 a share on July 11, 1997, to shareholders of record on June 25, 1997.</p>
<p>Lexington B &amp; L Financial is the holding company for B &amp; L Bank, a savings bank with assets of $59.7 million.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
